{
	"content": [
		{
			"category": "dialog",
			"role": "我",
			"illustrationIndex": 0,
			"text": "这会你可以告诉我这个地方叫什么了么？"
		},
		{
			"category": "dialog",
			"role": "喵栗",
			"roleId": 0,
			"illustrationIndex": 0,
			"text": "这里是猫城~（指了指东北方向）起源于那只大猫入睡的地方。"
		},
		{
			"category": "dialog",
			"role": "我",
			"illustrationIndex": 0,
			"text": "......大猫？"
		},
		{
			"category": "dialog",
			"role": "喵栗",
			"roleId": 0,
			"illustrationIndex": 1,
			"text": "嗯，他是城主，以前他那么温柔。"
		},
		{
			"category": "dialog",
			"role": "喵栗",
			"roleId": 0,
			"illustrationIndex": 0,
			"text": "后来不知道发生了什么，他变得暴躁，攻击靠近他的一切。"
		},
		{
			"category": "dialog",
			"role": "喵栗",
			"roleId": 0,
			"illustrationIndex": 1,
			"text": "真希望有一天它能变回原来的样子..."
		},
		{
			"category": "dialog",
			"role": "喵栗",
			"roleId": 0,
			"illustrationIndex": 0,
			"text": "不说这个啦，顺着这条路走下去有个路牌，猫城有三个路牌。"
		},
		{
			"category": "dialog",
			"role": "喵栗",
			"roleId": 0,
			"illustrationIndex": 0,
			"text": "它会指明你想去的地方，路牌的悬赏可以让你得到相应的报酬。"
		},
		{
			"category": "task",
			"taskType": 1,
			"taskId": 3,
			"refuse": [
				{
					"category": "dialog",
					"role": "我",
					"illustrationIndex": 0,
					"text": "我一会再去看看"
				}
			],
			"accept": [
				{
					"category": "dialog",
					"role": "我",
					"illustrationIndex": 0,
					"text": "还有报酬，我现在去瞅瞅"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}